nt\\\": \\\"Describing  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sprained ankle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It hurts.</br> It's throbbing.</br> I can't stand on it.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"headache/ migraine\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My head is pounding.</br> The light hurts my eyes.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stomach flu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have a fever.</br> I feel nauseous. My body hurts.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events or actions that are finished or completed, like a vacation.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Many verbs have a regular past tense form and end in -ed. Other verbs have irregular past tense forms. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular Past Tense Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to spend\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"spent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"see\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"saw\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"said\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"get\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"got\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "permit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document that says you can do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need a permit to go hiking in the Grand Canyon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about a canyon trip.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "canyon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a deep valley with water at the bottom", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We visited the Grand Canyon last year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "angel", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a heavenly being ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was tired. I felt like an angel helped me up the mountain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "helicopter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small aircraft that can go straight up ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We took a helicopter ride above the canyon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ankle ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the part of the foot that connects to the leg ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"},